Struktur Project pps-services-gateway-unipin
Project ini adalah HTTP client library (Go) yang jadi gateway ke Unipin API. 
Bukan HTTP server, tapi murni outbound client — dia nge-call API Unipin untuk 
keperluan in-game topup dan voucher. Saat ini main.go cuma demo/runner 
sederhana yang manggil GameList.

"
    pps-services-gateway-unipin/
    ├── cmd/app/main.go              ← Entry point (runner/demo)
    ├── internal/config/config.go    ← Load env vars (BASE_URL, PARTNER_ID, SECRET_KEY, TIMEOUT)
    ├── pkg/unipin/
    │   ├── client.go                ← HTTP client + auth helper + retry logic
    │   ├── types.go                 ← Error types (BusinessError, TechnicalError)
    │   ├── ingame_types.go          ← Request/Response structs untuk In-Game Topup
    │   ├── ingame_game_list.go      ← GET daftar game
    │   ├── ingame_game_detail.go    ← GET detail game + denomination
    │   ├── ingame_validate_user.go  ← Validasi user game
    │   ├── ingame_create_order.go   ← Buat order topup
    │   ├── ingame_order_inquiry.go  ← Cek status order
    │   ├── voucher_types.go         ← Request/Response structs untuk Voucher
    │   ├── voucher_list.go          ← GET daftar voucher
