"


Alur Coding dari Start ke Finish

1.  Startup (main.go)
    Set timezone ke Asia/Jakarta
    Init structured logger (slog JSON format)
    Load config dari environment variables via config.Load()
    BASE_URL — base URL Unipin API
    PARTNER_ID — partner ID kamu
    SECRET_KEY — secret key untuk auth
    TIMEOUT — timeout dalam detik (default 30s)
2.  Init Client (client.go)
    unipin.NewClient(baseURL, partnerID, secretKey, timeout, logger) bikin HTTP client
    Client nyimpen semua credential + http.Client dengan timeout
    Default retry: 2x retry (total 3 attempts) dengan backoff 300ms
3.  Authentication — 2 Mekanisme Berbeda
    In-Game Topup pakai HMAC-SHA256:

    "auth = HMAC-SHA256(partnerID + timestamp + path, secretKey)"

    Dikirim via HTTP headers: partnerid, timestamp, path, auth
    Voucher pakai SHA-256 hash:

    "signature = SHA256(partner_guid + logid + secret)"

    Dikirim di request body sebagai field signature

4. Setiap API Call Punya Pola yang Sama

    "
        Validasi input
            ↓
        Generate auth/signature
            ↓
        Marshal request body (JSON)
            ↓
        Retry loop (max 3 attempts):
            ├── Buat HTTP request dengan context + timeout
            ├── Set headers (Content-Type, auth headers)
            ├── Log outgoing request
            ├── Execute HTTP call
            ├── Log incoming response + duration
            ├── Handle error:
            │   ├── 5xx → TechnicalError (retryable)
            │   ├── 4xx → TechnicalError (not retryable)
            │   ├── Network/timeout → TechnicalError (retryable)
            │   └── Business error (status != 1) → BusinessError (not retryable)
            └── Unmarshal JSON response
            ↓
        Return typed response
    "

5. Fitur yang Tersedia
    
    In-Game Topup flow (urutan bisnis):
    1. GameList() — ambil daftar game yang tersedia
    2. GameDetail(gameCode) — ambil detail game + denomination (harga)
    3. ValidateUser(req) — validasi user ID game, dapet validation_token
    4. CreateOrder(req) — buat order topup pakai token + denomination
    5. OrderInquiry(referenceNo) — cek status order

    Voucher flow (urutan bisnis):
    1. VoucherList() — ambil daftar voucher
    2. VoucherDetail(voucherCode) — ambil detail + denomination voucher
    3. VoucherStock() — cek stok voucher
    4. VoucherRequest(req) — beli voucher, dapet serial/pin
    5. VoucherInquiry(referenceNo) — cek status pembelian

6. Error Handling
Dua tipe error yang jelas:

BusinessError — dari Unipin (misal: user not found, invalid game code). Tidak di-retry.
TechnicalError — network issue, timeout, 5xx. Di-retry otomatis dengan exponential backoff.




